  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": "1",
      "timing": "00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,540",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: Claude, I am heading to the kitchen for coffee. If you freeze up waiting for permission while I am gone..."
    },
    {
      "index": "2",
      "timing": "00:00:05,719 --> 00:00:10,262",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: You know I have to! As soon as I touch twenty files, the terminal locks until you press enter."
    },
    {
      "index": "3",
      "timing": "00:00:10,442 --> 00:00:16,297",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: And I come back half an hour later, and you have been sitting on Allow, yes or no, for twenty-nine minutes!"
    },
    {
      "index": "4",
      "timing": "00:00:16,477 --> 00:00:17,989",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: Not anymore. Look at your phone."
    },
    {
      "index": "5",
      "timing": "00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,176",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: My phone? What did you just install?"
    },
    {
      "index": "6",
      "timing": "00:00:20,356 --> 00:00:23,835",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: T3 Code. Theo and the team made it completely open source."
    },
    {
      "index": "7",
      "timing": "00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:27,460",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: Wait, my entire Claude Code session is streaming to my phone?"
    },
    {
      "index": "8",
      "timing": "00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:32,340",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: Full live terminal, file tree, and instant diffs. When I need permission, your phone buzzes."
    },
    {
      "index": "9",
      "timing": "00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,753",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: So I can approve file writes from the kitchen?"
    },
    {
      "index": "10",
      "timing": "00:00:34,932 --> 00:00:37,798",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: From the kitchen, from the elevator, or flat on your couch."
    },
    {
      "index": "11",
      "timing": "00:00:37,978 --> 00:00:40,972",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: Okay, what is the catch? How much is this costing me?"
    },
    {
      "index": "12",
      "timing": "00:00:41,152 --> 00:00:45,081",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: Zero dollars! In their FAQ it literally says: There is no way to pay us."
    },
    {
      "index": "13",
      "timing": "00:00:45,261 --> 00:00:47,752",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: Wait, so they do not even proxy my tokens?"
    },
    {
      "index": "14",
      "timing": "00:00:47,932 --> 00:00:54,039",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: Direct to your own keys. Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok, Antigravity. Fifty-two thousand GitHub stars."
    },
    {
      "index": "15",
      "timing": "00:00:54,219 --> 00:00:57,758",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: So I do not have to sit here staring at a progress bar at two AM?"
    },
    {
      "index": "16",
      "timing": "00:00:57,938 --> 00:01:01,287",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: Never again. Now go make that coffee. Your phone is about to buzz."
    },
    {
      "index": "17",
      "timing": "00:01:01,468 --> 00:01:03,444",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: Wait, what are you refactoring right now?"
    },
    {
      "index": "18",
      "timing": "00:01:03,624 --> 00:01:06,135",
      "text": "[CLAUDE]: The entire production authentication router!"
    },
    {
      "index": "19",
      "timing": "00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:07,087",
      "text": "[TARIQ]: Claude, no!"
    }
  ]
}